1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A clock stops before the visitor arrives.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The guard hears a phone ring.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,000
The caller describes an empty room.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:39,000
A door opens at the end of the hall.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:49,000
She recognizes the voice on the phone.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:59,000
The clock starts again.
